+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/*
+ * sha3-ce-core.S - core SHA-3 transform using v8.2 Crypto Extensions
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2018 Linaro Ltd <ard.biesheuvel@linaro.org>
